## Model and effort guidance

Output from this repo can reach a live site, so this matters.

| Task type | Use |
|---|---|
| Routine — drafts, doc edits, file organization, lookups | Faster model, medium effort |
| Analytical — page audits, keyword analysis, report QA | Faster model, high effort |
| High-stakes — anything a stakeholder reads | Strongest model, high effort |
| Live-impacting — robots directives, redirects, canonicals, structured data, any deployed change | Strongest model, high effort |

Rule of thumb: if a mistake would be seen by a stakeholder or go live on the site, use the
strongest model available.
